 "chapters": [
  {
   "title": "Summer 2027",
   "energy": 0.55,
   "shots": [
    {
     "narration": "Imagine it is the summer of twenty twenty-seven. Inside one data center, an AI is doing the work of a thousand of the world's best AI researchers.",
     "scene": "datacenter",
     "params": {
      "rows": 2,
      "racksPerRow": 18,
      "activity": 0.9
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "aisle",
      "to": "aisle_deep"
     },
     "overlays": [
      {
       "type": "tag",
       "text": "A scenario · Summer 2027",
       "at": 0.4
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "narration": "It runs day and night, in thousands of copies at once. And every week, it designs a smarter version of itself.",
     "scene": "neural_network",
     "params": {
      "layers": [
       5,
       8,
       10,
       8,
       4
      ],
      "activity": 0.95,
      "mode": "training",
      "speed": 1.3
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "wide",
      "to": "close"
     }
    },
    {
     "narration": "Its human bosses can no longer fully follow what it is building. They just watch the results keep getting better.",
     "scene": "neural_network",
     "continues": true,
     "params": {
      "activity": 1
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "close",
      "to": "side"
     }
    },
    {
     "narration": "That sounds like science fiction. But it is close to what a team of AI forecasters published this month.",
     "scene": "ai_core",
     "params": {
      "intensity": 0.8,
      "rings": 3
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "left",
      "to": "left",
      "orbit": 10
     },
     "overlays": [
      {
       "type": "lower",
       "text": "AI Futures Project",
       "sub": "Forecast update · November 2026",
       "at": "@forecasters"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "narration": "So what would it actually mean for AI to take over the world? How close are we? And what could stop it?",
     "scene": "backdrop",
     "params": {
      "style": "pillars"
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "wide",
      "to": "hero"
     },
     "overlays": [
      {
       "type": "bullets",
       "title": "Three questions",
       "items": [
        "What would it look like?",
        "How close are we?",
        "What could stop it?"
       ],
       "times": [
        "@what",
        "@how",
        "@stop"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "narration": "Let's walk through the scenario, step by step.",
     "scene": "backdrop",
     "params": {
      "style": "tunnel",
      "speed": 1.1
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "inside",
      "to": "off_axis"
     },
     "transition": "zoom",
     "tail": 1.5,
     "overlays": [
      {
       "type": "title",
       "align": "center",
       "kicker": "A scenario, explained in 3D",
       "text": "What If AI Takes Over in 2027?",
       "at": 0.2
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "The forecast",
   "energy": 0.6,
   "shots": [
    {
     "narration": "In twenty twenty-five, a team led by former OpenAI researcher Daniel Kokotajlo published a scenario called AI twenty twenty-seven.",
     "say": "In twenty twenty-five, a team led by former OpenAI researcher Daniel Kokotaylo published a scenario called A I twenty twenty-seven.",
     "scene": "backdrop",
     "params": {
      "style": "wave"
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "wide",
      "to": "low"
     },
     "transition": "dip",
     "overlays": [
      {
       "type": "chapter",
       "index": 1,
       "title": "The Forecast",
       "at": 0.2,
       "hold": 3.2
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "narration": "It described, month by month, how AI could go from a helpful assistant to something no human can keep up with.",
     "scene": "timeline",
     "params": {
      "events": [
       {
        "year": "2025",
        "title": "Scenario published"
       },
       {
        "year": "2026",
        "title": "AI agents go to work"
       },
       {
        "year": "Early 2027",
        "title": "Superhuman coder"
       },
       {
        "year": "Mid 2027",
        "title": "Superhuman AI researcher"
       },
       {
        "year": "Late 2027",
        "title": "Beyond human level"
       }
      ],
      "active": 1
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "along",
      "to": "at1"
     },
     "overlays": [
      {
       "type": "tag",
       "text": "AI 2027 scenario storyline",
       "at": 0.4
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "narration": "The key milestone is what they call a superhuman AI researcher. A system that does the job of the best human AI scientists, faster and far cheaper.",
     "scene": "timeline",
     "continues": true,
     "params": {
      "active": 3
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "at2",
      "to": "at3"
     }
    },
    {
     "narration": "This month, the team updated its forecast. All six of its forecasters now expect that milestone in twenty twenty-seven, unless the world deliberately slows down.",
     "scene": "ai_core",
     "params": {
      "intensity": 0.9,
      "rings": 4
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "right",
      "to": "right",
      "orbit": 12
     },
     "overlays": [
      {
       "type": "stat",
       "value": "2027",
       "label": "Expected by all 6 forecasters",
       "sub": "Superhuman AI researcher · AI Futures Project, Nov 2026",
       "pos": "left",
       "at": "@six"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "narration": "Kokotajlo himself now puts the odds at fifty-fifty by May of next year.",
     "say": "Kokotaylo himself now puts the odds at fifty-fifty by May of next year.",
     "scene": "donut",
     "params": {
      "centerLabel": "50%",
      "centerSub": "chance by May 2027",
      "highlight": 0,
      "data": [
       {
        "label": "By May 2027",
        "value": 50
       },
       {
        "label": "Later",
        "value": 50
       }
      ]
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "top",
      "to": "top",
      "orbit": 14
     },
     "overlays": [
      {
       "type": "source",
       "text": "Daniel Kokotajlo's personal forecast · Nov 2026"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "narration": "Why so soon? Because of one trend that keeps surprising everyone. Researchers at METR measure how long a task an AI agent can finish on its own.",
     "say": "Why so soon? Because of one trend that keeps surprising everyone. Researchers at Meter measure how long a task an A I agent can finish on its own.",
     "scene": "network_graph",
     "params": {
      "center": {
       "label": "One AI agent",
       "sub": "working alone"
      },
      "nodes": [
       {
        "label": "Write code"
       },
       {
        "label": "Run tests"
       },
       {
        "label": "Fix bugs"
       },
       {
        "label": "Research"
       },
       {
        "label": "Write report"
       }
      ],
      "direction": "out"
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "wide",
      "to": "hero"
     }
    },
    {
     "narration": "And that length has been doubling roughly every four months.",
     "scene": "line_chart",
     "params": {
      "title": "Task length AI agents can finish alone",
      "subtitle": "Illustrative: doubling every ~4 months",
      "suffix": " h",
      "decimals": 2,
      "xLabels": [
       "Month 0",
       "4",
       "8",
       "12",
       "16",
       "20",
       "24"
      ],
      "series": [
       {
        "label": "Hours of human work",
        "data": [
         0.25,
         0.5,
         1,
         2,
         4,
         8,
         16
        ]
       }
      ],
      "drawDur": 5
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "wide",
      "to": "front"
     },
     "overlays": [
      {
       "type": "source",
       "text": "Trend: METR · doubling-time estimates range ~3–7 months"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "narration": "In early twenty twenty-six, METR estimated that one model could handle tasks that take a skilled human about sixteen hours.",
     "say": "In early twenty twenty-six, Meter estimated that one model could handle tasks that take a skilled human about sixteen hours.",
     "scene": "line_chart",
     "continues": true,
     "params": {},
     "camera": {
      "from": "front",
      "to": "end"
     },
     "overlays": [
      {
       "type": "stat",
       "value": 16,
       "suffix": "+ hours",
       "label": "One model, early 2026",
       "sub": "METR estimate, wide uncertainty",
       "pos": "left",
       "at": "@sixteen"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "narration": "If that trend simply continues, by the end of next year AI agents could work on their own on projects that take people months.",
     "scene": "data_flow",
     "params": {
      "stages": [
       {
        "label": "Minutes",
        "sub": "2024",
