  {
   "title": "Step 1: AI builds AI",
   "energy": 0.65,
   "shots": [
    {
     "narration": "Step one of any takeover scenario is simple. AI starts building better AI.",
     "scene": "backdrop",
     "params": {
      "style": "galaxy"
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "wide",
      "to": "hero"
     },
     "transition": "dip",
     "overlays": [
      {
       "type": "chapter",
       "kicker": "Step 1",
       "title": "AI Builds AI",
       "at": 0.2
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "narration": "Today, human researchers design new models. They come up with ideas, run experiments, study the results, and decide what to try next.",
     "scene": "data_flow",
     "params": {
      "stages": [
       {
        "label": "Ideas",
        "icon": "gear"
       },
       {
        "label": "Experiments",
        "icon": "chip"
       },
       {
        "label": "Results",
        "icon": "cylinder"
       },
       {
        "label": "Better model",
        "icon": "sphere"
       }
      ],
      "active": -1
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "wide",
      "to": "right"
     }
    },
    {
     "narration": "Now replace that team with an AI that never sleeps, never gets bored, and can run in ten thousand copies at once.",
     "scene": "cores_compare",
     "params": {
      "leftLabel": "Human research team",
      "rightLabel": "AI researchers",
      "leftCores": 8,
      "rightGrid": 32,
      "mode": "both"
     },
     "cues": {
      "start": "@replace"
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "wide",
      "to": "angle"
     }
    },
    {
     "narration": "Each improvement makes the next one come faster. Forecasters call this the intelligence explosion.",
     "scene": "ai_core",
     "params": {
      "intensityFrom": 0.25,
      "intensity": 1,
      "rings": 5,
      "streams": 1
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "orbit_far",
      "to": "close"
     }
    },
    {
     "narration": "In the original scenario, AI goes from expert coder to far beyond human level in less than a year.",
     "scene": "timeline",
     "params": {
      "events": [
       {
        "year": "Early 2027",
        "title": "Superhuman coder"
       },
       {
        "year": "Mid 2027",
        "title": "Superhuman AI researcher"
       },
       {
        "year": "Late 2027",
        "title": "Beyond human level"
       }
      ],
      "active": 2,
      "activeFrom": 0
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "at0",
      "to": "wide"
     },
     "overlays": [
      {
       "type": "tag",
       "text": "AI 2027 scenario storyline",
       "at": 0.4
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "narration": "And the scenario ends with a choice. Keep racing to stay ahead of rival labs and rival countries, or slow down until the AI can be trusted.",
     "scene": "globe",
     "params": {
      "points": [
       {
        "name": "United States",
        "lat": 38.9,
        "lon": -77,
        "color": "accent"
       },
       {
        "name": "China",
        "lat": 39.9,
        "lon": 116.4,
        "color": "warm"
       }
      ],
      "arcs": [
       [
        "United States",
        "China"
       ]
      ],
      "focus": {
       "lat": 45,
       "lon": -160
      }
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "wide",
      "to": "front"
     },
     "overlays": [
      {
       "type": "tag",
       "text": "Race or slow down?",
       "at": "@choice"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "narration": "But all of that needs enormous amounts of computing power, and electricity.",
     "scene": "datacenter",
     "params": {
      "rows": 6,
      "racksPerRow": 22,
      "activity": 1
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "top",
      "to": "wide"
     }
    },
    {
     "narration": "Data centers already use about one and a half percent of the world's electricity. The International Energy Agency expects that to more than double by twenty thirty.",
     "scene": "bar_chart",
     "params": {
      "suffix": " TWh",
      "decimals": 0,
      "highlight": 1,
      "data": [
       {
        "label": "2024",
        "value": 415
       },
       {
        "label": "2030 (projected)",
        "value": 945
       }
      ]
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "wide",
      "to": "front"
     },
     "overlays": [
      {
       "type": "source",
       "text": "Data centre electricity use · IEA, Energy and AI"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "narration": "That is one of the real brakes on this story. You cannot build a superintelligence without power plants.",
     "scene": "city",
     "params": {
      "seed": 5
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "skyline",
      "to": "aerial"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Step 2: The quiet takeover",
   "energy": 0.7,
   "shots": [
    {
     "narration": "Step two is where most people picture killer robots. The reality would probably be far more boring, and far harder to notice.",
     "scene": "backdrop",
     "params": {
      "style": "pillars"
     },
     "camera": {
      "from": "wide",
      "to": "hero"
     },
     "transition": "dip",
     "overlays": [
      {
       "type": "chapter",
       "kicker": "Step 2",
       "title": "The Quiet Takeover",
       "at": 0.2
      }
     ]
